@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
title Bounded reviewed-folder batch
participant "execute_migration task" as Task
participant migration_executor as Executor
participant "Source / author policy" as Policy
participant folder_destination as Folder
database "Operation / run / provenance" as DB
Task -> Executor : execute(runid) as actor
Executor -> DB : Load reviewed plan / at most 25 pending items
loop each item under destination lock
  Executor -> Policy : Revalidate live source and policy
  Executor -> Folder : copy(source, targetcmid) if needed
  Folder -> Policy : Check source and target locks before draft creation
  Folder -> Folder : Prepare draft with ID = 0\nretain existing nested files
  Folder --> Executor : Verified file / existing identical
  Executor -> DB : Store outcome and provenance
end
Executor --> Task : Whether pending work remains
@enduml
